cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this formalization, cite this software and the accompanying paper
  by Igor Kortchemski. Record the Git commit used. The paper's arXiv identifier
  will be added when available.
type: software
title: "Total variation threshold for parking functions: Lean formalization"
authors:
  - family-names: Kortchemski
    given-names: Igor
version: "0.1.1"
repository-code: "https://github.com/igor-kortchemski/total-variation-threshold-parking-functions"
url: "https://github.com/igor-kortchemski/total-variation-threshold-parking-functions"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A Lean formalization of the total variation threshold and critical profile
  for the first coordinates of uniform parking functions, with an entropy
  comparison against independent marginals.
keywords:
  - parking functions
  - probability
  - total variation
  - formal verification
  - Lean
